# ---- Game data: copyrighted. Never commit, in any game folder. ----
*.iso
*.ISO
*.bin
*.cue
*.img
*.chd
*.xex
*.ark
*.hdr
*.vgs
*.bik
*.mogg
*.milo*
**/original_rom/
**/original_files/
**/original_isos/*
!/original_isos/README.md
**/original_iso/
**/extracted*/*
!**/extracted/README.md
**/rips/

# ---- Reverse-engineering output: contains original code. Never commit. ----
**/analysis/
**/ghidra/*
!**/ghidra/README.md
**/decomp/
*.gpr
*.rep/

# ---- NVIDIA DLSS SDK: downloaded by tools/fetch_dlss.sh ----
**/third_party/dlss/*
!**/third_party/dlss/README.md

# ---- Build output and signing keys ----
**/build/
**/engine/build_*/
**/dist/
**/local_builds/*
!**/local_builds/.gitkeep
**/.gradle/
**/android/app/.cxx/
**/local.properties
*.apk
*.aab
*.keystore
*.jks
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# ---- Editors / OS / tools ----
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.claude/
compile_commands.json

# ---- Local-only agent notes and launcher logs ----
**/agents/scratch/
gd-engine-launcher/logs/*
!gd-engine-launcher/logs/.gitkeep

# ---- Store screenshots: they show original game art. Local only. ----
res/screenshots/*
!res/screenshots/HOWTO.md
